      "id": "claim_2d097e6b90d04fae992fe17dbe8317ca",
      "statement": "The GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT Oracle table populated by GPI-C is keyed by UETR, which serves as the join key back to PPH's v2 identifiers.uetr, linking Swift gpi Tracker status data to PPH payments.",
