    {
      "id": "claim_e277d5a2e6784e698a7d39ef80fa7ecb",
      "statement": "gpi Tracker integration is batch, not real-time: GPI-C pulls changed transactions for outbound UETRs from the last 30 days every 4 hours (00/04/08/12/16/20 ET) and upserts results by UETR into GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT; there is no internal real-time API for gpi status keyed by UETR.",
      "evidence": [
        {
