      "id": "claim_f58ef32f4a2a4b09890087dae2b383ad",
      "statement": "The only consumers of UETR-keyed gpi Tracker data (GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT) are Payment Operations' Investigations Workbench and the TDIP nightly load (gpi_tracker_events); the snapshot table must not be exposed directly to client channels.",
