    {
      "id": "claim_b662eba7bebb4edabc1daa9b9915d16f",
      "statement": "The Swift Tracker API quota (250,000 calls/month, ~61% used by batch plus ad-hoc lookups) constrains any future use of UETR for finer-grained or real-time lookup; estimated per-payment lookup volume (~1.9M calls/month) would exceed the quota by ~7x, and a 2026-03-03 request to double batch frequency (PNG-1544) was declined for this reason.",
